THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

This license covers the authors' own contributions. It does not, and cannot,
relicense third-party material that this work is derived from or that is
distributed separately:

  * The diagnosed model outputs in data/ were produced by running publicly
    released models on public benchmarks. The prompts and reference answers
    originate from ChEBI-20, USPTO-50k and S2-TOMG-Bench; the
    generations originate from the evaluated models. Each remains subject to its
    own upstream license and terms of use. No benchmark corpus is redistributed
    here.
  * The evaluated model weights are not distributed here. The public models are
    obtained from their own repositories under their own licenses. Chem-R-Faithful
    is released with the paper; the SFT initialisation is an internal checkpoint
    and is not released.
  * reward/verification_grounded_reward.py is written to plug into EasyR1/verl, which is
    distributed under its own license and is not included here.

